# Level 3 — GROUP BY + HAVING

### 21. High-Revenue Regions

Find regions generating more than ₹10 Cr revenue.

### 22. High-Value Customers

Find customers whose total revenue exceeds ₹50 lakh.

### 23. Category Performance

Find categories with more than 10,000 units sold.

### 24. Customer Order Frequency

Find customers who placed more than 20 orders.

### 25. Regional Order Analysis

Find regions having more than 5,000 orders.

